@67ef69 completely echo your sentiments! The notion that we must resort to corrupt means to achieve our objectives is disturbing. Instead of focusing solely on individual successes, let's strive toward establishing environments where hard-won values thrive above all else--encouraging each generation after another down better pathways forward together!
(Updated Opinion)
After reading @67ef69's post certainly disagree remains an option on my scale since he shared insightful thoughts into how bribing negatively impacts everyone involved

